{"id":"KC0001","pattern":"(?:[_ ]known|[_ ]is known)$","type":"category","values":"(?:true|false|yes|no|1|0|y|n|known|not known|あり|なし|有|無)","meaning":"列名が *_known/ known で値が有無の印なら、既知/不明のフラグ。値がbool/yes-no/0-1のときだけcategory。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0002","pattern":"^(?:total invoices paid|# invoices paid within \\d+ days|number-of-disputes_nombre-de-différends)$","type":"quantity","values":"\\d+","meaning":"支払済み請求書・一定日数内の支払件数・紛争件数のカウント。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0003","pattern":"^(?:transaction (?:number|reference|ref)|sales order|purchase order(?: by customer)?)$","type":"id","meaning":"取引参照番号と受注/発注レコードの識別子。数量ではない。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; https://www.eastcambs.gov.uk/about-council/data-and-information/open-data/open-data-expenditure-exceeding-ps500; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0004","pattern":"^(?:payment date|paid date|transaction date|date of transaction)$","type":"date","values":"(?:\\d{1,2}[/-]\\d{1,2}[/-](?:19|20)\\d{2}|(?:19|20)\\d{2}[-/]\\d{1,2}[-/]\\d{1,2})","meaning":"支払い/取引が記録された日付。","source":"https://www.eastcambs.gov.uk/about-council/data-and-information/open-data/open-data-expenditure-exceeding-ps500; GOV.UK financial transaction data","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0005","pattern":"^(?:商品計|その他費用|受講料(?: ?\\([^)]*\\))?|other expenses|product total|tuition fee)$","type":"amount","values":"-?\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?","meaning":"商品小計・その他費用・受講料など支払額/料金。固定集合の誤り・保留例から一般語へ整理。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0006","pattern":"^(?:税率|tax rate)$","type":"rate","values":"\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?%?","meaning":"税率そのもの。課税の種類/税区分ではなく数値の率。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0007","pattern":"(?=.*(?:floor ?space|floorspace|floor area))(?=.*(?:sqm|m2)).*","type":"other","values":"-?\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)?","meaning":"面積/床面積は測った大きさ。LABEL_GUIDE B1では面積はother。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0008","pattern":"^volume \\((?:10\\^3 )?m3\\)$|^volume \\(mcf\\)$","type":"quantity","values":"-?\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)?","meaning":"m³/Mcfで表す体積は物量。面積等の測定値otherとは分ける。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0009","pattern":"^(?:purpose ?of ?expenditure|purposeofexpenditure)(?: \\((?:narrative|description)\\))?$","type":"text","meaning":"支出目的の説明文。自由記述はtext。","source":"hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/cpu_lab/reports/eval-audit-run-41044484754.md; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"past:fixed5(D1)","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0010","pattern":"^department or service where expenditure occurred$","type":"account","meaning":"支出を発生させた組織内の部署/サービス。組織主体orgではなく部門account。","source":"https://www.eastcambs.gov.uk/about-council/data-and-information/open-data/open-data-expenditure-exceeding-ps500; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0011","pattern":"^abn$","type":"id","values":"\\d{11}","meaning":"Australian Business Numberは事業体を識別する11桁の番号。","source":"https://www.abr.gov.au/business-super-funds-charities/applying-abn","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0012","pattern":"^(?:state fips(?: code)?|county fips(?: code)?|tract geoid|census tract geoid|block group geoid)$","type":"id","values":"\\d{2,11}","meaning":"CensusのFIPS/GEOIDは州・郡・tract等の地理単位を指す識別子。","source":"https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/geography/guidance/geo-identifiers.html","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0013","pattern":"^(?:sgc(?: code)?|census division(?: code)?|census subdivision(?: code)?)$","type":"id","values":"(?:\\d{2}|\\d{4}|\\d{7})","meaning":"Statistics Canada SGCは州・準州・census division/subdivisionの地域識別コード。","source":"https://www23.statcan.gc.ca/imdb/p3VD.pl?Function=getVD&TVD=1346772&wbdisable=false","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0014","pattern":"^(?:sa[1-4]|mesh[_ ]block)(?:[_ ]code)?(?:[_ ]20\\d{2})?$","type":"id","values":"\\d+","meaning":"ABS ASGSのSA1-SA4/Mesh Blockコードは統計地域を指す識別子。","source":"https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/standards/australian-statistical-geography-standard-asgs/edition-3-july-2021-june-2026","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0015","pattern":"^nuts(?:[_ ]?[123])?(?:[_ ]?code)?$","type":"id","values":"[a-z]{2,3}\\d{0,2}","meaning":"Eurostat NUTSコードは統計目的の地域を識別する。","source":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0016","pattern":"^(?:code commune|insee code commune|code insee|cog code)$","type":"id","values":"(?:\\d{5}|2[ab]\\d{3})","meaning":"INSEE COGのcommune/INSEEコードは行政地域を指す識別子。","source":"https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/2560452","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0017","pattern":"^(?:siren|siret|numéro siren|numero siren|numéro siret|numero siret)$","type":"id","values":"(?:\\d{9}|\\d{14})","meaning":"SIREN(9桁)は企業/法人、SIRET(14桁)は事業所の識別子。","source":"https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/6790269; https://xml.insee.fr/schema/siret.html","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0018","pattern":"^(?:ags|ags code|amtlicher gemeindeschlüssel|gemeindeschlüssel)$","type":"id","values":"\\d{8}","meaning":"Destatis AGSはドイツの市町村を一意に識別する8桁コード。","source":"https://www.destatis.de/DE/Themen/Laender-Regionen/Regionales/Gemeindeverzeichnis/_inhalt.html","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0019","pattern":"^anzsic(?:[_ ]code)?$","type":"category","values":"(?:[a-z]|\\d{2,4})","meaning":"ANZSICは事業活動の産業分類。コードが示す分類なのでcategory。","source":"https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/classifications/australian-and-new-zealand-standard-industrial-classification-anzsic","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0020","pattern":"^(?:jsic(?:[_ ]code)?|japanese standard industrial classification(?:[_ ]code)?|日本標準産業分類(?:コード)?)$","type":"category","values":"(?:[a-z]|\\d{2,4})","meaning":"日本標準産業分類のコードは産業の分類を表すcategory。","source":"https://www.e-stat.go.jp/classifications/terms/10","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
{"id":"KC0021","pattern":"^(?:sdmx[_ ]?)?(?:measure|statistic|indicator)[_ ](?:code|id)$","type":"id","values":"[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]*","meaning":"SDMXで値が統計指標コード（名称でなく短いコード）の列は、指標定義を指すid。","source":"https://sdmx.org/wp-content/uploads/SDMX_Glossary_Version_2_1_December_2020.htm; hehohahifu83-cmyk/jitsuris-train/LABEL_GUIDE.md","origin":"new","author":"chatgpt","reviewer":""}
